    {
      "id": 996000000106,
      "plugin": "Cardinal",
      "model": "TextEditor",
      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "width": 34,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / ORIGINAL PERFORMANCE PATCH\nCINEMATIC PULSE SCORE -- PLAY HOST MIDI\n\nA film-score patching study (NOT audio-tested).\nHOST MIDI pitch -> Morph VCO and gate -> ADSR 1.\nADSR 1 opens VCA 1 before STATE FILTER.\nFILTER HP -> ECHO right (continuous path).\nFILTER LP -> VCA 2 -> ECHO left (pulsed path).\nECHO L/R -> independent HOST AUDIO L/R jacks.\n\nCLOCKED LFO is FREE-RUNNING at 0.8 Hz.\nNO HostTime, CLK or RESET cable is saved;\nthere is NO DAW BPM or transport sync.\nLFO PULSE +/-5V -> ADSR 2 gate -> VCA 2 CV.\nLFO SINE +/-5V -> MORPH VCO shape CV.\nADSR gate threshold is +1V in Fundamental.\n\nMACRO8 unipolar 0..+10V, four A-D scenes:\nOUT 0 TENSION -> STATE FILTER resonance CV\nOUT 1 WARMTH -> STATE FILTER drive CV\nOUT 2 REPEATS -> STEREO ECHO feedback CV\nOUT 3 SPACE -> STEREO ECHO wet mix CV\n\nA HUSH:   RES 8%, DRIVE 2%, FB 16%, WET 20%\nB MOTION: RES 12%, DRIVE 5%, FB 24%, WET 28%\nC SURGE:  RES 20%, DRIVE 9%, FB 35%, WET 40%\nD RETURN: RES 11%, DRIVE 4%, FB 25%, WET 30%\n\nRecall A/B/C/D over 2.6-second transitions.\nLIVE uses knobs; scenes are performer-triggered.\nEcho TIME is fixed at 460ms (not BPM synced).\nPulse duty28%, LFO period1.25s in free mode.\n\nHost and both VCA levels reduced by design;\nmonitor quietly and check tails/clipping in DAW.\nNo real-host playback or sound claim yet.\n"
      },
      "pos": [
        135,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
